station-event-ert-delta5-enroute = Attention all station personnel: Emergency Response Team Delta-5, designated "Vanguard", has been dispatched to your sector. The team is sent to reinforce local security forces and help contain the threat. Civilian personnel are advised to continue their regular duties. Follow the orders of security staff and do not leave your departments until the threat is neutralized.
station-event-ert-epsilon6-enroute = Attention all station personnel: Emergency Response Team Epsilon-6, designated "Valkyrie", has been dispatched to your sector to restore control over the situation, as it exceeds the capabilities of station security. Remaining security units are to provide the team with up-to-date information on the threat's location, forces involved and the state of the station. Further actions are coordinated by ERT command. Civilian personnel are ordered not to interfere with the team until the threat is eliminated.
station-event-ert-nu7-enroute = Attention all station personnel: Emergency Response Team Nu-7, designated "Hammer Strike", is dispatched to the station to clear the facility of hostile combatants and neutralize any other threats to restore control. Surviving security personnel are to provide ERT command with information on the facility's state and the positions of remaining forces. Disobeying ERT orders is punishable by lethal force. Command of the operation is transferred to the Nu-7 team leader until personnel are evacuated.
station-event-ert-alpha9-enroute = Attention all station personnel: Emergency Response Team Alpha-9, designated "Last Hope", is dispatched to the sector to prevent the loss of control over the facility. Civilian personnel are ordered not to interfere with ERT forces, and disobeying the team's orders is punishable by execution on the spot. All active units are to provide team command with information on the facility's state, the threat's location and available forces. Coordination is transferred to the Alpha-9 commander until the situation is stabilized. Do not count on evacuation: preserving the corporate facility is the priority.
station-event-ert-eta77-enroute = Attention all station personnel: Emergency Response Team Eta-77, designated "Sphere Within a Sphere", is dispatched to your sector to counter theological threats due to high activity of aggressive religious anomalies. Security units are to provide team command with information on identified cult members. Team Eta-77 is granted exclusive authority to immediately use lethal force against persons merely suspected of hostile activity.
station-event-ert-theta4-enroute = Attention all station personnel: CBURN Theta-4, designated "Heart Blade", is dispatched to the sector due to the spread of an invasive parasitic organism. Security units are to provide team command with information on identified outbreaks, the last confirmed location of the organisms and the state of the containment lines. Personnel are ordered not to approach infected zones and not to move discovered biological samples. Command of the containment operation is transferred to the Theta-4 commander.
station-event-ert-beta7-enroute = Attention all station personnel: CBURN Beta-7, designated "Isolation Camp", is dispatched to the sector due to the spread of a dangerous infectious agent. All surviving personnel are ordered to find an isolated safe place and wait for the facility to be cleared. The team will evacuate personnel once the threat is eliminated. Discovered infected are subject to immediate liquidation by Beta-7. Command of the containment operation is transferred to the team commander.
